  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient and self-reliant crisis-affected communities in Lebanon and RD Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed action is directly aligned with Syria Humanitarian Needs Overview (HNO) 2021 and Humanitarian Response Plan (HRP) 2020 and a more holistic approach, with &quot;life -saving assistance being provided alongside carefully targeted support for the expansion of basic services and livelihood opportunities&quot; . It is particular aligned with Objective 1: Access to quality life -saving and sustaining services and assistance, and particular access to Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) services. Objective 2: Protection especially Gender Based Violence (GBV) services and strategic Objective 3: Increase Resilience and Access to Services seeking to reduce the degree and frequency with which communities depend on humanitarian assistance to cover their most basic needs, wherever possible, in particular livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
